",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjS_qmn8NSWAxWPZfUHHWFNGU0Q3IcHCLcBKAc",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2026／4\n搬到新店面，用餐體驗大大升級，菜單品項有多了一些，烤物很有水準，燒肉豬一樣好吃。\n------------------------------\n雖然受限於營業空間沒辦法像一般店面有華麗的裝潢，沒有舒服的內用區，但是提供的餐點並不馬虎，絕對有店面餐廳的水準。\n白飯煮得好吃，豚燒豬肉調味也很好，便當附菜中規中矩，玉子燒好吃，滷蘿蔔醬色完美沁入但是又不會軟爛跟調味過重，很有水準。\n自從園軒鮮魚湯沒做了之後，我在這附近變得很難覓食一直找不到愛店，幸好現在又發現這間由兩位很有禮貌態度和善的年輕人經營的平價日式簡餐小食堂。",null,[0,78]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5805133374735975260/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWTUU5RVNtaE5WVlpQV1ZSQ1VHSlhTakpYYlhoUFZtcEdTR1JyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5805133374735975260/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWTUU5RVNtaE5WVlpQV1ZSQ1VHSlhTakpYYlhoUFZtcEdTR1JyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5805133374735975260/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWTUU5RVNtaE5WVlpQV1ZSQ1VHSlhTakpYYlhoUFZtcEdTR1JyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5805133374735975260/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWTUU5RVNtaE5WVlpQV1ZSQ1VHSlhTakpYYlhoUFZtcEdTR1JyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5805133374735975260/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWTUU5RVNtaE5WVlpQV1ZSQ1VHSlhTakpYYlhoUFZtcEdTR1JyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5805133374735975260/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWTUU5RVNtaE5WVlpQV1ZSQ1VHSlhTakpYYlhoUFZtcEdTR1JyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,10309,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25VME9ESmhNVVZPWVRCUGJXSjJXbXhPVmpGSGRrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7f12a7a48b923042!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnU0ODJhMUVOYTBPbWJ2WmxOVjFHdkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25VME9ESmhNVVZPWVRCUGJXSjJXbXhPV